        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4 italic">"As soon as I filled the form, I got an instant call on WhatsApp and the installation was done the same day. Very professional team."</p>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-800">- Amit Singh (Noida)</h4>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>